          <declname>Idx</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Contains all the implemented transformations on CR logical operations. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For example, a binary CR logical can be used to split a block on its inputs, a unary CR logical might be used to change the condition code on a comparison feeding it. A nullary CR logical might simply be removable if the user of the bit it [un]sets can be transformed. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
