        <type><ref refid="classbool" kindref="compound">bool</ref></type>
        <definition>bool anonymous_namespace{PPCReduceCRLogicals.cpp}::PPCReduceCRLogicals::splitBlockOnBinaryCROp</definition>
        <argsstring>(CRLogicalOpInfo &amp;CRI)</argsstring>
        <name>splitBlockOnBinaryCROp</name>
        <qualifiedname>anonymous_namespace{PPCReduceCRLogicals.cpp}::PPCReduceCRLogicals::splitBlockOnBinaryCROp</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="structanonymous__namespace_02_p_p_c_reduce_c_r_logicals_8cpp_03_1_1_p_p_c_reduce_c_r_logicals_1_1_c_r_logical_op_info" kindref="compound">CRLogicalOpInfo</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>CRI</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Splits a block that contains a CR-logical operation that feeds a branch and whose operands are produced within the block. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Example: vr5&lt;def&gt; = CMPDI vr2, 0; CRRC:vr5 G8RC:vr2 vr6&lt;def&gt; = COPY vr5:sub_eq; CRBITRC:vr6 CRRC:vr5 vr7&lt;def&gt; = CMPDI vr3, 0; CRRC:vr7 G8RC:vr3 vr8&lt;def&gt; = COPY vr7:sub_eq; CRBITRC:vr8 CRRC:vr7 vr9&lt;def&gt; = CROR vr6&lt;kill&gt;, vr8&lt;kill&gt;; CRBITRC:vr9,vr6,vr8 BC vr9&lt;kill&gt;, &lt;BB#2&gt;; CRBITRC:vr9 Becomes: vr5&lt;def&gt; = CMPDI vr2, 0; CRRC:vr5 G8RC:vr2 vr6&lt;def&gt; = COPY vr5:sub_eq; CRBITRC:vr6 CRRC:vr5 BC vr6&lt;kill&gt;, &lt;BB#2&gt;; CRBITRC:vr6</para>
<para>vr7&lt;def&gt; = CMPDI vr3, 0; CRRC:vr7 G8RC:vr3 vr8&lt;def&gt; = COPY vr7:sub_eq; CRBITRC:vr8 CRRC:vr7 BC vr9&lt;kill&gt;, &lt;BB#2&gt;; CRBITRC:vr9 </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
